The `stripLeadingHyphens` method in `Util` class is responsible for removing leading hyphens from a string. Here is the code snippet of the method:

```java
static String stripLeadingHyphens(String str)
{
    if (str.startsWith("--"))
    {
        return str.substring(2, str.length());
    }
    else if (str.startsWith("-"))
    {
        return str.substring(1, str.length());
    }

    return str;
}
```

